          "scene": {
            "concept": "the Shrouded Fable expansion",
            "ground_noun": "forest floor",
            "lighting": "Diffuse cool daylight filters through mist from the upper left.",
            "rendering": "Use storybook trading-card linework, muted jade and indigo colors, and deep atmospheric layering.",
            "setting": "The artwork contains a mist-covered mountain forest, twisted old trees, distant mossy shrine stones without symbols or writing, and layered veils of blue-green folklore atmosphere."
